# Code owners (OpenSpec change adopt-pr-workflow). The ruleset does not require code-owner review
# (single maintainer; GitHub forbids self-approval), so this routes review requests and documents ownership.
# Non-owner PRs are gated instead by the trusted-author gate (gate-external-pr-automation): ecc-review waits for the
# owner's "/ecc-review <head sha>" and auto-merge stays off, so the owner merges them by hand. The trusted list itself
# (.github/trusted-authors.json) is covered by /.github/ below.
*                     @prix0007

# Security-relevant paths, listed explicitly so a future second maintainer can be added per area.
/.github/             @prix0007
/.gitleaks.toml       @prix0007
/contracts/src/       @prix0007
/packages/vault-crypto/ @prix0007
/tools/recover/src/   @prix0007
/openspec/            @prix0007
